# Scout run artifacts. A scout run writes these into the CURRENT directory, so
# running scout from the FlexFactor checkout leaves them in the repo root as
# untracked noise (found there 2026-08-16). They are per-run evidence, not
# source - same class as the audit logs above.
_scout_report.json
.flexfactor-scout-proposals.json
